      <AppProse>

<p><em>Last reviewed April 2026.</em></p>

<h1>Scarborough Alternatives: Top Competing Tools for 2026</h1>

<p>Teams compare Scarborough alternatives when they need national psychographics, global research, audience activation, segmentation, or consumer data enrichment. Scarborough is strongest for local US market intelligence, so alternatives vary by the planning question.</p>

<h2>Quick Comparison</h2>

