<h2>MRI-Simmons</h2>
<p>MRI-Simmons provides national consumer research, psychographics, media behavior, and brand preference data.</p>
<p><strong>Best for:</strong> US audience strategy and consumer profiling.</p>
<p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Enterprise custom quote.</p>
<p><strong>Key differentiators vs Scarborough:</strong> Stronger for national consumer insight; Scarborough is stronger for local DMA-level planning.</p>
<p><a href="/mri-simmons">Learn more about MRI-Simmons on MPT -></a></p>

<h2>GWI</h2>
<p>GWI provides global survey-based consumer research across attitudes, behaviors, media habits, and brand categories.</p>
<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Global audience and consumer insight work.</p>
<p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Public Free and Plus tiers, plus custom Teams and Pro plans.</p>
<p><strong>Key differentiators vs Scarborough:</strong> Broader international coverage; less focused on US local markets.</p>
<p><a href="/gwi">Learn more about GWI on MPT -></a></p>

<h2>Resonate</h2>
<p>Resonate offers consumer intelligence, psychographic segmentation, and audience activation capabilities.</p>
<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Marketers who need research connected to activation.</p>
<p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Enterprise custom quote.</p>
<p><strong>Key differentiators vs Scarborough:</strong> More activation-oriented; Scarborough is more local market research-oriented.</p>
<p><a href="/resonate">Learn more about Resonate on MPT -></a></p>

<h2>Claritas</h2>
<p>Claritas provides consumer segmentation, local market intelligence, and audience targeting products.</p>
<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Teams that use segmentation systems for local and direct marketing decisions.</p>
<p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Custom quote.</p>
<p><strong>Key differentiators vs Scarborough:</strong> Stronger segmentation and targeting orientation; different data methodology and product ecosystem.</p>

<h2>Experian</h2>
<p>Experian provides consumer data, identity, enrichment, and marketing audience products.</p>
<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Data-driven marketers enriching customer and prospect audiences.</p>
<p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Enterprise custom quote.</p>
<p><strong>Key differentiators vs Scarborough:</strong> More focused on data enrichment and addressable marketing; Scarborough is a local survey research product.</p>

<h2>How to Choose</h2>
<p>Choose Scarborough for local market planning. Choose MRI-Simmons for national consumer psychographics, GWI for global research, Resonate for activation-oriented audience intelligence, and Claritas or Experian for segmentation and enrichment.</p>

<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<h3>What is the closest Scarborough alternative?</h3>
<p>MRI-Simmons is the closest for consumer research, but it is more national than local. Claritas is closer for local segmentation.</p>
<h3>Which alternative is best for global research?</h3>
<p>GWI is the strongest option in this group for global research.</p>
<h3>Which alternative is best for activation?</h3>
<p>Resonate and Experian are more activation-oriented than Scarborough.</p>
<h3>Do Scarborough alternatives publish pricing?</h3>
<p>Most enterprise research and data platforms use custom pricing. GWI is an exception with some public self-serve tiers.</p>
<h3>Can Scarborough be replaced for local TV planning?</h3>
<p>Sometimes, but Scarborough's local DMA depth is the reason many agencies and broadcasters use it for local media planning.</p>

